* ============================================================================
*  Device models for the Polivoks VCF board (sheet 7, У4)
*
*  EVERYTHING in this file is a reconstruction. No uA776 / К140УД12 datasheet
*  or die schematic was available, so the op-amp is built as the published
*  741 topology with every bias current mirrored 1:1 from the Iset pin, which
*  is how the uA776 family is described (all currents programmed by Iset,
*  internal Miller compensation).  Values marked EST are estimates.
* ============================================================================

* --- discrete parts --------------------------------------------------------
* КТ315Г: small-signal NPN, h21э 50..350.                       EST (generic)
.model KT315G NPN(IS=2e-14 BF=150 VAF=100 IKF=0.1 CJE=7p CJC=7p TF=0.5n RB=40)
* КТ361Б: complementary PNP.                                    EST (generic)
.model KT361B PNP(IS=2e-14 BF=100 VAF=80 IKF=0.1 CJE=9p CJC=9p TF=0.7n RB=40)

* --- on-chip devices of the uA776 reconstruction -----------------------------
* vertical NPN                                                  EST
.model QN NPN(IS=1e-16 BF=250 VAF=130 CJE=0.6p CJC=0.4p CJS=1.5p TF=0.4n RB=200)
* lateral PNP: low beta, slow (fT a few MHz)                    EST
.model QL PNP(IS=1e-16 BF=50 VAF=50 CJE=0.3p CJC=1.0p TF=25n RB=300)
* substrate PNP (output pull-down)                              EST
.model QS PNP(IS=1e-16 BF=80 VAF=60 CJE=0.5p CJC=1.5p TF=5n RB=200)
.model DN D(IS=1e-16 CJO=0.5p)

* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  uA776 / К140УД12 — transistor netlist of the SGS-Thomson UA776 datasheet
*  (April 1995, "Schematic diagram", p.2).  Topology and the labelled resistor
*  values (R1,R2 10k; R3 2k; R4,R8 50; R6,R7 100; C1) are from that drawing.
*  EST: device models, C1 = 25 pF (fits datasheet SR 0.8 V/us and GBW 0.1 MHz),
*  the unlabelled resistor between R4 and R6 (taken as 100), and the areas of
*  Q13 (x2, so Q7 is biased) and Q12 (x5, so supply current ~ 11*Iset and output current ~3 mA at
*  Iset = 1.5 uA, matching the datasheet table).
*  pins: inp inm vp vn out iset      (Iset is drawn OUT of pin 8)
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt UA776 inp inm vp vn out iset
* Iset mirror: Q17 diode, Q16/Q13/Q12 copies
Q17  iset iset vp QL
Q16  n18  iset vp QL
Q13  nn   iset vp QL 2
Q12  nt   iset vp QL 5
* input stage (741-type CC-CB) with Q14/Q15/Q19 tail loop
Q14  c12 c12 vp QL
Q15  nb  c12 vp QL
Q1   c12 inp e1 QN
Q2   c12 inm e2 QN
Q3   c3  nb  e1 QL
Q4   c4  nb  e2 QL
Q5   c3  c3  r1 QN
Q6   c4  c3  r2 QN
R1   r1  vn  10k
R2   r2  vn  10k
* Q16 -> Q18 diode; Q19 sinks Iset from nb, Q20 sinks Iset from nm
Q18  n18 n18 vn QN
Q19  nb  n18 vn QN
Q20  nm  n18 vn QN
* second stage: Q7 PNP follower, Q8 diode level shift, Q9 CE gain
Q7   vn  c4  nn QS
Q8   nn  nn  nm QN
Q9   nl  nm  vn QN
C1   c4  nt  25p
* class-AB bias string and output
R3   nt  nu  2k
Q21  nu  nt  e21 QN
Q22  nl  nl  e21 QL
Q11  vp  nu  e11 QN
R4   e11 o1  50
Q23  nu  e11 o1 QN
R5   o1  oi  100
R6   oi  out 100
R7   oi  o2  100
R8   o2  e10 50
Q24  nl  e10 o2 QL
Q10  vn  nl  e10 QS
.ends UA776

* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  КР140УД8Б (A1): JFET-input op-amp, GBW ~1 MHz, SR ~2 V/us.  Behavioural.
*  pins: inp inm vp vn out
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt K140UD8 inp inm vp vn out
Gin 0 n1 inp inm 1e-3
Rin n1 0 2e8
Cin n1 0 160p
B2  n2 0 V = max(min(v(n1), 11.5), -11.5)
Rout n2 out 100
.ends K140UD8
